      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Reconnect session\n\nState: `edgeId`, `movingEnd`, original source/target node and Port, anchored endpoint, pointer position, compatible candidate, and validation result.\n\nCommit through one `reconnectEdge` mutation. Never invoke Port creation behavior. Empty, invalid, or cancelled drops restore the original endpoint. V1 does not create dangling edges or negotiate a new edge type.",
